     2136     for each bf_tt-allsum on error undo, return error return-value :
     2137       find first bf_tt-allsum-line where bf_tt-allsum-line.sum-type = bf_tt-allsum.sum-type no-error.
     2138       if not available bf_tt-allsum-line then do:
     2139         create bf_tt-allsum-line.
